{"id": "EUVD-2026-76479", "enisaUuid": "3e79b529-1fce-3310-b21d-d7782985acf4", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nkho: fix size calculation in kho_preserved_memory_reserve()\n\nkho_preserved_memory_reserve() calculates the size of a preservation by\ndoing 1 << (order + PAGE_SHIFT). Since the '1' is a 32-bit integer, it\ncan only be shifted by 31. That is, it will only work for preservations\nup to 2 GiB. Larger preservations will trigger undefined behaviour.\n\nWhile preservations larger than 2 GiB can't be obtained via folios\ncurrently, they can be obtained via kho_preserve_pages().\n\nFor example, memblock reserve_mem uses kho_preserve_pages().\nReservations larger than 2 GiB are valid and will trigger this bug if\nproperly aligned.\n\nFix it by using 1UL for shifting.", "datePublished": "2026-09-11T19:44:38", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:49:01", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0692a8fdf0222af130c8ea97426f1c3bf3814905", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/42a6f03cf352eb6e6dbeef95e75e686f4cdb9bd1", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3a0b8fa2eb36afc88b62a95f33f0c77c71fa5ded"], "aliases": ["GHSA-832m-273v-9hpc", "CVE-2026-89568"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2fb99bd0-4243-3233-86a8-1490f1c85b94", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.4"}, {"id": "3d203317-2682-3b33-a7fd-f276cd9303ca", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "8e6f500d-d7a7-3a79-b9cc-26afa3ce91d7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "9575f9fe-2f7e-3973-b4e7-4b7eada7378b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "fc33e4b44b2717feba2f6f07ce7943a96499c9ec <42a6f03cf352eb6e6dbeef95e75e686f4cdb9bd1"}, {"id": "a0f7b296-b456-3cda-ab68-b7747bdb4254", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "fc33e4b44b2717feba2f6f07ce7943a96499c9ec <3a0b8fa2eb36afc88b62a95f33f0c77c71fa5ded"}, {"id": "b769e9bb-6fcc-31a9-8d29-d46fef683e1e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.57"}, {"id": "ef16c02b-00e4-324b-8725-b924eb35b72e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "fc33e4b44b2717feba2f6f07ce7943a96499c9ec <0692a8fdf0222af130c8ea97426f1c3bf3814905"}, {"id": "f30ca286-62d0-31f1-80a9-8be0aea59ac4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.16"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "76907d04-d766-3292-9e1f-ee33261c8586", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}